{#
  The plan as something to put on the fridge.

  Paper first, not adapted from the dark web UI: one column per DATE with that
  day's sessions stacked inside, a colour per sport, the coach's reason for the
  week on top, and the athlete's own zones and paces at the bottom so the sheet
  stands on its own at the track with no phone in hand. Page breaks are
  controlled so a week is never cut in half.

  2026-09-11 redesign ("dignos de la refri"): same information, less noise --
  the columns used to be one per SESSION ("LUN 1A SES.", "LUN 2A SES."), the
  header claimed "4 semanas" on a one-week plan, and every step repeated its
  block. See _report_style for the shared palette.

  2026-10-22 (el responsable): «una sola página sólo con la semana de entreno; las zonas, mejor en el
  macrociclo, que es un documento más largo y no va en la refri». UNA hoja por semana, cada una con su
  cabecera; sin el porqué ni las tablas de zonas (cada paso ya lleva su pulso o su ritmo al lado, y las
  tablas están en la hoja del macrociclo).
#}
<!doctype html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>Tu semana — {{ payload.athlete_name }}</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  @page { size: A4 landscape; margin: 9mm 9mm; }

{% include "_report_style.html.jinja2" %}

  body { font-size: 8.6pt; line-height: 1.32; }

  /* --- Why this week, and its shape at a glance -------------------------- */
  .overview { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; gap: 12px; align-items: start; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .rationale {
    margin: 0; font-size: 8.6pt; line-height: 1.4; color: #2c3038;
    border-left: 4px solid var(--brand); background: var(--band); border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0; padding: 7px 11px;
  }
  .rationale b.lead {
    display: block; font-size: 6.8pt; letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: 2px;
  }
  .split { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px; justify-content: flex-end; max-width: 330px; }
  .chip {
    font-size: 7.6pt; padding: 2px 8px 2px 6px; border-radius: 999px; white-space: nowrap;
    background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--rule); display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px;
  }
  .chip::before { content: ""; width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--sport, var(--other)); }
  .chip b { font-family: var(--mono); font-weight: 700; }
  .chip.rest-chip { color: var(--ink-soft); }
  .chip.off-watch { border-color: var(--warn); color: var(--warn); }
  .chip.off-watch::before { background: var(--warn); }

  /* --- The calendar ------------------------------------------------------ */
  .week { margin-bottom: 10px; break-inside: avoid; page-break-inside: avoid; }
  .week-label {
    display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline;
    font-size: 7.5pt; font-weight: 800; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .1em;
    color: var(--ink-soft); margin: 0 0 5px;
  }
  .week-label .volume { font-weight: 500; text-transform: none; letter-spacing: 0; font-family: var(--mono); }

  .days { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(7, 1fr); gap: 5px; align-items: stretch; }
  .col { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; min-width: 0; }
  .col-head {
    display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 5px; padding: 0 2px 3px; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--ink);
  }
  .col-head .dname { font-weight: 900; font-size: 9pt; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .02em; }
  .col-head .dnum { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 8pt; color: var(--ink-soft); margin-left: auto; white-space: nowrap; }

  .session { display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex: 1; }
  .day {
    flex: 1; border: 1px solid var(--rule); border-top: 4px solid var(--sport, var(--other));
    border-radius: 6px; padding: 5px 6px 6px; break-inside: avoid; background: #fff;
  }
  .day.rest {
    border: 1px dashed var(--rule-strong); border-top-width: 1px; background: var(--band);
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: 60px;
  }
  .rest-label { font-size: 8pt; color: var(--ink-faint); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; }

  .tagline { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 4px; margin-bottom: 2px; }
  .sport {
    font-size: 6.4pt; font-weight: 800; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .08em;
    color: #fff; background: var(--sport, var(--other)); border-radius: 3px; padding: 1px 5px;
  }
  .slot { font-size: 6.4pt; color: var(--ink-faint); font-weight: 700; }
  .duration { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 7.8pt; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink); }
  .focus { font-weight: 800; font-size: 9pt; line-height: 1.2; margin: 2px 0 2px; letter-spacing: -.005em; }
  /* Dos lineas: el proposito entero esta en la app; en la nevera basta la idea. */
  .purpose { display: -webkit-box; -webkit-box-orient: vertical; -webkit-line-clamp: 3; overflow: hidden; }
  .purpose { font-size: 7.2pt; color: var(--ink-soft); margin: 0 0 4px; line-height: 1.3; }

  /* Los pasos van SEGUIDOS, separados por "›", no uno por renglon. Uno por
     renglon en una columna de 37 mm apilaba una natacion de 8 pasos hasta
     14 cm: medido sobre la semana real del atleta 2, la hoja salia en dos
     paginas. Seguidos se leen como un entrenador los dicta. */
  ol.steps { list-style: none; margin: 3px 0 0; padding: 0; font-size: 7.4pt; line-height: 1.38; }
  ol.steps li { display: inline; }
  ol.steps li:not(:last-child)::after { content: " › "; color: var(--rule-strong); font-weight: 700; }
  .step-numbers { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 6.8pt; color: var(--accent); font-weight: 700; margin-left: 2px; }
  li.repeat { display: inline; }
  .repeat-label { font-weight: 800; }
  .repeat-label .x {
    font-family: var(--mono); background: var(--brand); color: var(--brand-ink); border-radius: 3px; padding: 0 3px;
  }
  li.repeat ol.steps { display: inline; margin: 0; }
  li.repeat ol.steps::before { content: "("; color: var(--ink-faint); }
  li.repeat ol.steps::after { content: ")"; color: var(--ink-faint); }

  .strength { margin-top: 4px; }
  ol.strength-list { margin: 3px 0 0; padding-left: 13px; font-size: 7.5pt; }
  ol.strength-list li { margin-bottom: 2px; }
  ol.strength-list li::marker { color: var(--sport); font-weight: 800; }
  .dose { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 7pt; color: var(--accent); font-weight: 700; }
  .strength-cue { font-size: 6.8pt; color: var(--ink-soft); }
  .strength-group-label { font-size: 6.8pt; font-weight: 800; color: var(--sport); margin-top: 3px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .04em; }
  ol.strength-list.strength-group { list-style: none; padding-left: 6px; margin-top: 1px; }
  .strength-phase { font-size: 7pt; color: var(--ink-soft); margin-top: 3px; }

  .manual, .strength .tag {
    display: block; margin-top: 4px; font-size: 6.4pt; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .06em;
    color: var(--warn); font-weight: 800;
  }
  .manual { border: 1px solid var(--warn); border-radius: 5px; padding: 4px 5px; }
  .manual-label { display: block; margin-bottom: 2px; }
  .manual-body { font-size: 7.4pt; text-transform: none; letter-spacing: 0; color: var(--ink); font-weight: 400; white-space: pre-line; }

  .adaptation {
    margin-top: 5px; padding-top: 4px; border-top: 1px dotted var(--rule-strong);
    font-size: 6.9pt; color: var(--ink-soft); line-height: 1.3;
  }
  .adaptation::before { content: "Si no es tu día · "; font-weight: 800; color: var(--ink); }

  /* Una hoja por semana: la segunda empieza en su propia página. */
  .page + .page { margin-top: 28px; }

  /* On screen the sheet sits on a desk; on paper it fills the page. */
  @media screen { .sheet, .print-bar { max-width: 1100px; } .sheet { padding: 18px 20px; } }
  @media print {
    .chip, .manual, .day { break-inside: avoid; }
    .page + .page { break-before: page; page-break-before: always; margin-top: 0; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="print-bar">
  <button type="button" onclick="window.print()">Descargar PDF / Imprimir</button>
  <span>En el diálogo elige «Guardar como PDF». Orientación horizontal, tamaño A4, con «gráficos de fondo» activado.</span>
</div>

<div class="sheet">
  {# The target comes from the step's STRUCTURED fields (v6 Track 7), not from
     whatever the model happened to repeat in its prose. #}
  {% macro render_steps(steps, sport) %}
  <ol class="steps">
    {% for step in steps %}
    {% if step.substeps %}
    <li class="repeat">
      <span class="repeat-label"><span class="x">{{ step.repeat_count }}×</span>{% set extra = repeat_extra(step) %}{% if extra %} {{ extra }}{% endif %}</span>
      {{ render_steps(step.substeps, sport) }}
    </li>
    {% else %}
    <li>
      <span class="step-text">{{ step.description }}</span>
      {% set dur = step_duration(step) %}{% set tgt = step_target(step, sport) %}
      {# La duracion solo si el texto no la dice ya: "10' entrada suave en Z2"
         seguido de "10' · Z2" era la misma informacion dos veces. #}
      {% if dur and dur in step.description %}{% set dur = '' %}{% endif %}
      {% if dur or tgt %}<span class="step-numbers">{{ dur }}{% if dur and tgt %} · {% endif %}{{ tgt }}</span>{% endif %}
    </li>
    {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
  </ol>
  {% endmacro %}


  {% for week in payload.weeks %}
  {% set head = week_heads.get(week.week_number) %}
  {% set summary = week_summaries.get(week.week_number) %}
  <section class="page">
  <header class="masthead">
    <div>
      <div class="brand">Power Coach AI · Plan de Entrenamiento</div>
      <h1>Tu semana{% if head.range %} · {{ head.range }}{% endif %}</h1>
      <div class="who">{{ payload.athlete_name }}{% if generated_at %} · generado el {{ generated_at }}{% endif %}</div>
    </div>
    <div class="facts">
      <div class="fact"><div class="v">{{ head.sessions }}</div><div class="l">sesiones</div></div>
      <div class="fact"><div class="v">{{ head.time }}</div><div class="l">entreno</div></div>
      <div class="fact"><div class="v">{{ head.rest_days }}</div><div class="l">descanso</div></div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="week">
    {% if summary %}
    <div class="overview" style="grid-template-columns: 1fr">
      <div class="split" style="justify-content: flex-start; max-width: none">
        {% for label, minutes in summary.by_discipline %}
        <span class="chip s-{{ chip_sport.get(label, 'other') }}">{{ label }} <b>{{ minutes | round | int }}'</b></span>
        {% endfor %}
        {% if summary.rest_days %}<span class="chip rest-chip">Descanso <b>{{ summary.rest_days }}</b></span>{% endif %}
        {% if summary.off_watch %}<span class="chip off-watch">{{ summary.off_watch }} no van al reloj</span>{% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>
    {% endif %}

    <div class="days">
      {% for col in week_columns.get(week.week_number, []) %}
      <div class="col">
        <div class="col-head">
          <span class="dname">{{ col.dia }}</span>
          <span class="dnum">{{ col.numero }} {{ col.mes }}</span>
        </div>
        {% if col.descanso %}
        <div class="day rest"><div class="rest-label">Descanso</div></div>
        {% else %}
        {% for day in col.sesiones %}
        <div class="session s-{{ day.sport }}">
        <div class="day">
          <div class="tagline">
            <span class="sport">{{ discipline_labels.get(day.discipline, day.sport) }}</span>
            {% set slot = slot_label(day) %}{% if slot %}<span class="slot">{{ slot | trim }}</span>{% endif %}
            {% if day.total_duration_minutes %}<span class="duration">{{ day.total_duration_minutes | round | int }}'</span>{% endif %}
          </div>
          <div class="focus">{{ day.focus }}</div>
          {% if day.purpose %}<div class="purpose">{{ day.purpose }}</div>{% endif %}
          {% if not (day.strength_block and day.strength_block.exercises) %}{{ render_steps(day.steps, day.sport) }}{% endif %}
          {# A session Garmin cannot hold is handed over as written
             instructions (v5 Track 5). If it is not on the page, the athlete
             never sees it at all. #}
          {% if day.manual_instructions %}
          <div class="manual">
            <span class="manual-label">No va al reloj — hazla desde aquí</span>
            <div class="manual-body">{{ day.manual_instructions }}</div>
          </div>
          {% endif %}
          {# La sesión de fuerza, entera y sin pasos repetidos: en el gimnasio,
             entre serie y serie, una hoja no se apaga ni pide desbloquearse
             con las manos sudadas. #}
          {% if day.strength_block and day.strength_block.exercises %}
          <div class="strength">
            {% if day.strength_block.groups %}
            {# Beta 3.0: superseries. Lo que va seguido, junto y con su descanso entre rondas. #}
            {% for g in day.strength_block.groups %}
            {% set letra = g.label or "ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ"[loop.index0] %}
            <div class="strength-group-label">{{ letra }}{% if g.exercises|length > 1 %} · {{ g.exercises|length }} seguidos{% endif %}{% if g.rest_between_rounds_s %} · {{ g.rest_between_rounds_s }}s entre rondas{% endif %}</div>
            <ol class="strength-list strength-group">
              {% for ex in g.exercises %}
              <li>
                <b>{{ letra }}{{ loop.index }} · {{ ex.name }}</b> <span class="dose">{{ ex.sets }}×{{ ex.reps }}{% if ex.load %} · {{ ex.load }}{% endif %}</span>{% if ex.change %} <span class="strength-cue">({{ ex.change }})</span>{% endif %}
              </li>
              {% endfor %}
            </ol>
            {% endfor %}
            {% else %}
            <ol class="strength-list">
              {% for ex in day.strength_block.exercises %}
              <li>
                <b>{{ ex.name }}</b> <span class="dose">{{ ex.sets }}×{{ ex.reps }}{% if ex.load %} · {{ ex.load }}{% endif %}{% if ex.rest_seconds %} · {{ ex.rest_seconds }}s{% endif %}</span>
              </li>
              {% endfor %}
            </ol>
            {% endif %}
            {# El porqué de la semana en una línea (2026-09-23: antes no salía en la hoja). #}
            {% if day.strength_block.dose %}<div class="strength-phase">Dosis {{ "mínima" if day.strength_block.dose == "minima" else "reducida" }}{% if day.strength_block.dose_reason %}: {{ day.strength_block.dose_reason }}{% endif %}</div>{% endif %}
            {% if day.strength_block.skipped %}<div class="strength-phase">Esta semana sin: {{ day.strength_block.skipped | map(attribute="name") | join(", ") }}</div>{% endif %}
            {% if day.strength_block.placement_note %}<div class="strength-phase">{{ day.strength_block.placement_note }}</div>{% endif %}
            {% if day.garmin_exportable is sameas false %}<span class="tag">No va al reloj</span>{% endif %}
          </div>
          {% endif %}
          {% if day.adaptation %}<div class="adaptation">{{ day.adaptation }}</div>{% endif %}
        </div>
        </div>
        {% endfor %}
        {% endif %}
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="sheet-footer">
    <span>Power Coach AI · escrito a partir de tus datos reales de Garmin. Tus zonas y ritmos, en la hoja de tu temporada.</span>
    <span>{{ payload.athlete_name }}</span>
  </div>
  </section>
  {% endfor %}
</div>

<script>
  /* Cada semana cabe en UNA hoja: justo antes de imprimir se reduce lo justo,
     nunca por debajo del 72 % (por debajo ya no se lee en la nevera; si no
     cabe, sigue en otra hoja). Sin esto una semana con dos dias de dos
     sesiones salia partida en dos paginas. */
  (function () {
    var MM = 96 / 25.4, ALTO = (210 - 18) * MM, ANCHO = (297 - 18) * MM;
    /* Antes de encoger, cada dia recibe el ancho que pide su contenido: con siete
       columnas iguales la hoja media lo que el dia mas largo y un descanso ocupaba
       lo mismo que una fuerza con bici. Semana real del atleta 2 del 26-oct (fuerza
       y bici el martes): con columnas iguales hacia falta reducirla al 56 % (no se
       lee); repartidas, al 82 %. La del 19-oct pasa del 73 % al 100 %. */
    function repartir(g) {
      var cols = Array.prototype.slice.call(g.children);
      g.style.alignItems = 'start';
      var dias = g.querySelectorAll('.session, .day');
      dias.forEach(function (d) { d.style.flex = 'none'; });
      for (var vuelta = 0; vuelta < 4; vuelta++) {
        var descanso = cols.map(function (c) { return !c.querySelector('.day:not(.rest)'); });
        var area = cols.map(function (c, i) {
          var r = c.getBoundingClientRect();
          return descanso[i] ? 0 : r.width * r.height;
        });
        var total = area.reduce(function (a, b) { return a + b; }, 0) || 1;
        var n = cols.length;
        g.style.gridTemplateColumns = area.map(function (a, i) {
          return (descanso[i] ? 0.62 : Math.max(0.8, n * a / total)).toFixed(3) + 'fr';
        }).join(' ');
      }
      g.style.alignItems = '';
      dias.forEach(function (d) { d.style.flex = ''; });
    }
    function ajustar() {
      document.querySelectorAll('.page').forEach(function (p) {
        p.style.zoom = 1;
        p.querySelectorAll('.days').forEach(repartir);
        var r = p.getBoundingClientRect();
        var z = Math.min(1, (ALTO * 0.97) / r.height, ANCHO / Math.max(r.width, 1));
        p.style.zoom = Math.max(0.72, z);
      });
    }
    function soltar() {
      document.querySelectorAll('.page').forEach(function (p) { p.style.zoom = 1; });
      document.querySelectorAll('.days').forEach(function (g) { g.style.gridTemplateColumns = ''; });
    }
    window.addEventListener('beforeprint', ajustar);
    window.addEventListener('afterprint', soltar);
  })();
</script>

</body>
</html>
